Package: @source_basename@-source-@version@
Meta-Rules-Target: source
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.linux.nosource !pkg.linux.quick>
Architecture: all
Section: kernel
Build-Depends: patchutils, xz-utils
Depends: binutils, xz-utils, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: build-essential, bc, rsync, kmod, cpio, bison, flex, libelf-dev, libssl-dev, @source_basename@-config-@version@
Suggests: libncurses-dev | ncurses-dev, qtbase5-dev, pkgconf
Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: Linux kernel source for version @version@ with Intel patches
 This package provides source code for the Linux kernel version @version@
 with Intel-specific patches that are not yet integrated into the mainline
 Linux kernel. These patches include Intel platform support, performance
 optimizations, and features developed by Intel for Intel hardware.
 .
 This source closely tracks official Linux kernel releases with additional
 Intel-contributed modifications.
